# Jelajah katalog (publik, tanpa login). Jalankan `make reset-dev` dulu supaya data contoh masih berlaku.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3030/api/v1
@lat = -6.2433
@lng = 106.7989

### Home tab makanan (rail nearby, deals, popular, offer_merchants)
# @name home
GET {{baseUrl}}/home?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}&tab=human

### Home tab pakan & kompos
GET {{baseUrl}}/home?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}&tab=farm

### Pencarian di home (other_tab_match_count = hasil di tab lain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/home?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}&q=roti

### Daftar listing, halaman 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}&page=1&limit=5

### Terdekat dalam 3 km
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}&sort=nearest&max_km=3

### Termurah / diskon terbesar / gratis / pakan
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?sort=cheapest
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?sort=biggest_discount
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?free=true
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?tier=animal_feed

### Detail listing (ID pertama dari home)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{home.response.body.$.data.nearby[0].id}}?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}

### Halaman toko
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{home.response.body.$.data.nearby[0].merchant.id}}?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}
